   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to enhance the Prime Ministrys ability to implement national priorities and reforms, ensuring effective resource allocation and performance monitoring to achieve measurable results. It addresses Yemens humanitarian and development crisis, focusing on building capacity within three key units: the Rapid Response Unit, Transparency Reinforcement Unit, and Policies and Strategies Unit. These units support the Prime Minister and government ministries in implementing critical refor</narrative>
